---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Overton Prestige collects, uses and protects your personal information when you use our website or send us an enquiry. Compliant with UK data protection law."
>
  <PageHeader eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy Policy" lead="Last updated: May 2026" />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="legal-content">
        <p>
          This policy explains what information {site.name} collects when you use
          this website, how we use it, and the rights you have. {site.name} is a
          vehicle dealership based at {site.addressOneLine}.
        </p>

        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Enquiry details.</strong> When you use one of our enquiry
            forms, we collect the information you provide, typically your name,
            phone number, email address and the details of your enquiry.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Usage data.</strong> We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to
            understand how the site is used. It is privacy-friendly, does not use
            cookies, and does not collect information that identifies you
            personally.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <p>
          We use the information you send us only to respond to your enquiry and
          to provide the service or information you have asked for. We do not
          sell your information, and we do not use it for marketing without your
          consent.
        </p>

        <h2>Legal basis</h2>
        <p>
          Under UK data protection law, we process your enquiry details on the
          basis of taking steps at your request before potentially entering into
          a contract, and our legitimate interest in responding to people who
          contact us.
        </p>

        <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Formspree</strong> processes our website form submissions and
            forwards them to us.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Cloudflare</strong> hosts this website and provides the
            privacy-friendly analytics described above.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not share your information with anyone else unless we are
          required to by law.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This website does not set any cookies, and our analytics provider does
          not use cookies either.
        </p>

        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          We keep enquiry details only for as long as we need them to deal with
          your enquiry and to keep reasonable records of our business activity,
          after which they are deleted.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You have the right to ask us for a copy of the information we hold
          about you, to have it corrected or deleted, and to object to how we use
          it. To make a request, contact us at
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or call {site.phone}.
        </p>

        <h2>Complaints</h2>
        <p>
          If you are unhappy with how we have handled your information, you can
          complain to the Information Commissioner's Office at
          <a href="https://ico.org.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
            >ico.org.uk</a
          >.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. Any changes will be shown
          on this page with a revised date.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          {site.name}<br />
          {site.addressOneLine}<br />
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> &middot; {site.phone}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
